Package: swangui
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Frank <FrankMncrf@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, strongswan-swanctl, charon-systemd, polkitd | policykit-1, nftables, iproute2, openssl, iputils-ping
Recommends: systemd-resolved, python3-cryptography, libsecret-tools, network-manager
Homepage: https://github.com/FrankMncrf/SwanGUI
Description: FortiClient-style IPsec VPN client for strongSwan
 Tray application to create, edit, import/export, connect and monitor
 strongSwan IPsec VPNs (IKEv1/IKEv2, PSK, certificates, EAP, XAuth) with
 split DNS, kill switch, trusted networks, diagnostics and vendor
 import/export (FortiClient, MikroTik, pfSense, Windows, Cisco, Apple).
